  "articleBody": "A garage-to-ADU conversion can add independent living space, but the project must first prove that the existing garage, property, utilities, and intended layout can meet applicable zoning, building, fire, energy, and health requirements. A qualified design-build team can evaluate the structure, prepare plans, coordinate permits, and manage construction through final inspection.",
